/-!
# A358111

The multiplicative inverse of the coefficients of the factorially normalized Bernoulli polynomials (provided they do not vanish, otherwise by convention 0).

The 55 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A358111

